=2 Walkthrough
!SurvivalSkillsGuide.png|right|Survival Skills Flowchart
* Talk to {n:Apolliane} to start the quest.
* **Mine** a {i:Marble Nugget|Marble Nugget|3921}.

:* The marble nugget __must__ be obtained through mining on the character completing the quest. You may not buy or trade a nugget.

::* You may mine Marble Nugget before starting the quest and it will work upon trading it after flagging the quest.

:* Make sure {p:Ionis} is on to reduce the mining fatigue found in Adoulin areas.

::* {n:Floralie} inside the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} in {z:Western Adoulin} (E-8) sells {i:Trailblazing Pickaxes|Trailblazing Pickaxe|6002} in exchange for 500 Bayld each; these grant more attempts at mining than {i:Pickaxes|Pickaxe|605} before being fatigued.
::* {n:Floralie} also sells {i:Trbl. Pickaxe +1|Trbl. Pickaxe +1|6003} at 1,000 Bayld each which grant even more mining attempts before being fatigued.
::* {n:Tevigogo}, in the corner to the left of the Western Adoulin Ionis NPC sells ordinary {i:Pickaxes|Pickaxe|605}.

* Mining points in {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} are located across the map.

:* Getting to many of these mining points requires you to pass by several {m:Bedrock Crags|Bedrock Crag} to get across the zone.

* Trade your Marble Nugget to {n:Apolliane} to receive your reward.

